const description: { en: string; ja: string } = {"en":"Two oak leaves face to face, their tips together at the top with a white line between them. A leaf's outer edge is four round scallops and one wide arc across the top; its foot is cut on a slant, so that the two leaves part in a V. A white midrib curves up it, with five white veins outside the midrib and six between it and the middle, each an arc. The right leaf is built in full, then its stalk, then the left leaf and its stalk where they stand; the two stalks cross.","ja":"柏の葉を二枚、先を上で合わせて向かい合わせに置き、間に白い線を一本通します。葉の外側の縁は、四つの丸いふくらみと、上を渡る大きな一つの弧でできています。足は斜めに切るので、二枚の葉はV字に分かれます。白い中肋を弧で通し、その外側に五本、内側（中心側）に六本の白い葉脈を、どれも弧で通します。右の葉、その葉柄の順に作図し、左の葉と葉柄はその場で作図します。二本の葉柄は交差します。"};

